  "question": {
    "text": "In the cobalt-carbonyl complex : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msub><mi>Co</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><mi>CO</mi></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>, number of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Co</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>Co</mi></math> bonds is &quot;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math>&quot;&nbsp;and terminal <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi></math> ligands is &quot;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math>&quot;.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>=</mo></math>___",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7a98c11d-b260-43d2-ba4a-d3fa1286d1bd-85c7c0ae-81cf-4a0b-984b-ac8d7b0d8e4b-image.png\" style=\"width: 260px; height: 135px;\" /></p><p>The number of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Co</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>Co</mi></math> bonds are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and the number of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Co</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>CO</mi></math>&nbsp;terminal&nbsp;bonds are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>. Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>.</p>",
